# Saving the ditch (physics phase 31): sf-scooter-ditch-bail's seed, the same 5 rad/s twist to the right, but
# spin held left through the first 0.3 s of the air: the board comes down 50 degrees off, a stumble, and the
# combo lands.
park sf
seed 8
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 358.9 323.7 -1.08 45
tap use 30
hold up 40..398
tap up 400
tap down 406
bot balance
tap ollie 700
hold spinL 704..740
run 1000
expect event scooterDitch{spin=-5.015} within 699..703
expect event land{quality=stumble} within 811..815
expect event comboLanded{name=Scooter Wheelie + Scooter Ditch,points=1010} within 811..815
expect no event bail
